OL,3,GNEWSAEngland hockey player got 'hooked'
OL,4,Aat local club
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hockey player representing England in
OL,7,Fthe World Cup says his first club
OL,8,F"still holds a very, very fond place"
OL,9,Fin his heart.
OL,11,FNick Bandurak, from Wolverhampton,
OL,12,Fscored twice in a 4-2 victory over
OL,13,FIndia on Monday and added another in an
OL,14,F8-2 success against Wales on Wednesday.
OL,16,FHe started at Cannock Hockey Club and
OL,17,Fdescribed going on to represent his
OL,18,Fcountry as "incredible".
OL,20,FThe forward said he was about four when
OL,21,Fhe started "messing about" with a
OL,22,Fhockey stick.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
